      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 4.59,
          "en": "Now to conclude this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.59,
          "end": 7.65,
          "en": "there's one last animation which I want to perform,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.65,
          "end": 11.253,
          "en": "and that's an animation across multiple screens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.27,
          "end": 16.41,
          "en": "When I select a meal here on this meals list screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.41,
          "end": 19.35,
          "en": "and we then transition to this meal detail screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.35,
          "end": 21.96,
          "en": "I'd like to animate this image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.96,
          "end": 26.96,
          "en": "so that it slides from this screen to the next screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.48,
          "end": 31.83,
          "en": "And whilst this might sound super fancy and complex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.83,
          "end": 34.68,
          "en": "it actually, thankfully, isn't",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.68,
          "end": 37.08,
          "en": "because Flutter has built in support",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.08,
          "end": 40.86,
          "en": "for animating widgets across multiple screens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.86,
          "end": 44.49,
          "en": "And for that here, we can go to the meals.dart file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.49,
          "end": 47.37,
          "en": "where I have this list of meals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.37,
          "end": 49.26,
          "en": "and then actually to the meal item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.26,
          "end": 54.26,
          "en": "because that is where I do have the image of my meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.69,
          "end": 55.523,
          "en": "Here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.64,
          "end": 59.58,
          "en": "And we now have to wrap this image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.58,
          "end": 62.25,
          "en": "so in this case, this FadeInImage widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.25,
          "end": 65.61,
          "en": "which is responsible for outputting the final image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.61,
          "end": 67.35,
          "en": "with another widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.35,
          "end": 72.03,
          "en": "And that other widget here is the so-called Hero widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.03,
          "end": 74.313,
          "en": "another widget built into Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.24,
          "end": 77.1,
          "en": "And whilst the name might be strange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.1,
          "end": 79.83,
          "en": "this simply is a widget that exists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.83,
          "end": 83.46000000000001,
          "en": "to animate widgets across different widgets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.46000000000001,
          "end": 86.373,
          "en": "across different screens typically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.53,
          "end": 90.57,
          "en": "For that, Hero needs a child,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.57,
          "end": 93.24000000000001,
          "en": "which is the widget that should be animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.24000000000001,
          "end": 96.06,
          "en": "But in addition, it also needs a tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.06,
          "end": 98.28,
          "en": "which behind the scenes will be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.28,
          "end": 101.58,
          "en": "for identifying a widget on this screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.58,
          "end": 103.173,
          "en": "and on the target screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.16,
          "end": 107.94,
          "en": "And here, I'll give this a tag of meal.id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.94,
          "end": 111.99000000000001,
          "en": "It should be a tag that is unique per widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.99000000000001,
          "end": 114.3,
          "en": "And of course here, I have multiple meals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.3,
          "end": 116.1,
          "en": "and multiple images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.1,
          "end": 119.43,
          "en": "So therefore every image should get its own tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.43,
          "end": 121.05,
          "en": "when wrapped in Hero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.05,
          "end": 123.3,
          "en": "And the ID is unique per meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.3,
          "end": 126.603,
          "en": "and therefore is the perfect tag per image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.59,
          "end": 129.12,
          "en": "So that's the first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 131.88,
          "en": "We wrap the widget that should be animated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.88,
          "end": 134.49,
          "en": "and you are not limited to images, by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.49,
          "end": 137.49,
          "en": "though images are a common case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.49,
          "end": 141.18,
          "en": "But you wrap that widget that should be animated with Hero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.18,
          "end": 142.413,
          "en": "and give it a tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.37,
          "end": 145.53,
          "en": "And now you have to go to the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.53,
          "end": 147.81,
          "en": "where you want to animate to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.81,
          "end": 150.81,
          "en": "And of course, there must be a logical connection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.81,
          "end": 152.61,
          "en": "between these two places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.61,
          "end": 154.92000000000002,
          "en": "For example, here we're on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.92000000000002,
          "end": 156.81,
          "en": "where we're coming from,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.81,
          "end": 158.85,
          "en": "and now I'm going to the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.85,
          "end": 162.603,
          "en": "where we are going to, the meal details screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 163.89,
          "end": 166.56,
          "en": "And here in this meal details screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 166.56,
          "end": 168.9,
          "en": "you have to find the same widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.9,
          "end": 170.57999999999998,
          "en": "to which you want to animate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.57999999999998,
          "end": 173.52,
          "en": "So in my case here, this image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.52,
          "end": 177.63,
          "en": "And it does not matter that this is now not a fade in image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 177.63,
          "end": 179.4,
          "en": "but a network image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 179.4,
          "end": 181.08,
          "en": "The only important thing is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.08,
          "end": 183.57,
          "en": "that it's generally the same content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 183.57,
          "end": 185.91,
          "en": "and that will be the case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.91,
          "end": 189.993,
          "en": "And now you wrap this widget here with Hero as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190.86,
          "end": 194.073,
          "en": "So I'm wrapping my Image.network with Hero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195,
          "end": 197.79,
          "en": "and you have to give it exactly the same tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 197.79,
          "end": 199.803,
          "en": "so again, meal.id here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.51,
          "end": 203.57999999999998,
          "en": "Because that's important for Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.57999999999998,
          "end": 206.49,
          "en": "to identify the widget on both the start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 206.49,
          "end": 208.62,
          "en": "and the target screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 208.62,
          "end": 209.97,
          "en": "That's all you have to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 209.97,
          "end": 212.49,
          "en": "If you now save this and restart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 212.49,
          "end": 216.12,
          "en": "you will see that if you go to this list of meals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216.12,
          "end": 220.2,
          "en": "and you tap a meal, this image now animates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 220.2,
          "end": 223.5,
          "en": "between the screens, forth and back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 223.5,
          "end": 226.53,
          "en": "And that of course, makes this animation look a bit nicer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 226.53,
          "end": 227.88,
          "en": "than it did before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 227.88,
          "end": 231.78300000000002,
          "en": "And as you saw, adding this is really simple.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
